<title>UK: UK's Wickes non-exec director resigns.</title>
<headline>UK's Wickes non-exec director resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wickes Plc, the DIY retailer -- hit by accounting irregularities last summer which have triggered a fraud investigation -- said on Wednesday that its non-executive director Sanford Kaplan had resigned.</p>
<p>The resignation is with immediate effect and the company was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
